{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00786","headline":"郊庙歌辞 周郊祀乐章 昭顺乐 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 周郊祀乐章 昭顺乐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五兵勿用，万国咸安。\n告功圆盖，受命云坛。\n乐鸣凤律，礼备鸡竿。\n神光欲降，衆目遐观。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00786.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00786","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}